        <title>closed note 3377924 (near Széchenyi-lakótelep, Belváros, Cegléd) / Created &lt;time title=&quot;28 September 2022 at 19:57&quot; datetime=&quot;2022-09-28T19:57:20Z&quot;&gt;over 2 years ago&lt;/time&gt; by &lt;a class=&quot;mw-100 d-inline-block align-bottom text-truncate text-wrap&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; href=&quot;https://www.openstreetmap.org/user/Mateusz%20Konieczny&quot;&gt;Mateusz Konieczny&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div class=&quot;note-comment-text&quot;&gt;https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/3454580741

Is there drinking water available here or not? It can be water fountain, water tap, maybe even hand pump, spring and so on.

It is marked as 

amenity = drinking_water
disused:amenity = drinking_water

so it is marked as both active and disused at the same time.

